<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Through death into life everlasting</l><l>He passed, and we follow Him there;</l><l>O’er us sin no more hath dominion</l><l>For more than conqu’rors we are!</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>His Word shall not fail you, He promised;</l><l>Believe Him and all will be well;</l><l>Then go to a world that is dying,</l><l>His perfect salvation to tell!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
